Z||000003||Dan87GT||04-23-2001||12:31 PM||||The fastener is about 5 inches down from the top of the piller cover, it looks like the same type that is used on the "A" piller, except there is a small round hole in the body for the fastener in insert into. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||tgowens||04-23-2001||02:41 PM||||the fastener is the same as on the upper right and left of the inside door panels - don't have the part number handy but I will tell you this - with the seat belt attached and the long phillips head screw in the door jamb, there is no way that B pillar is going anywhere (it also "snaps" over the end of the A pillar) -- ||||reg||1
